# State Management

| Concern | Tool | Location |
|---------|------|----------|
| Server/async data | TanStack Query | `features/*/api/*.queries.ts` |
| UI/client state | Zustand | `features/*/store/*.store.ts` |
| URL state | TanStack Router search params | route files |

## Anti-patterns

- Storing server data in Zustand (use Query cache).
- Global monolithic store (one store per feature).
- Fetching inside components (use query hooks).
- Duplicating Query data in local state.
